{"title": "Pact of the Blade", "pageid": 14022, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the action to summon a new pact weapon. For the action to bind an existing weapon, see <a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Pact_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Pact Weapon\">Bind Pact Weapon</a>. For the Pact Boon, see <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Pact of the Blade (passive feature)\">Pact of the Blade (passive feature)</a>.  </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pact_of_the_Blade.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Pact_of_the_Blade.webp/300px-Pact_of_the_Blade.webp, /w/images/0/03/Pact_of_the_Blade.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Pact_of_the_Blade.webp/300px-Pact_of_the_Blade.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Pact_of_the_Blade.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Pact of the Blade</b> is a class action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlocks</a> that choose <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Pact of the Blade (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Pact of the Blade (passive feature)\">Pact of the Blade</a> at level 3. It allows the warlock to conjure a magical weapon of a chosen type. Alternative, warlocks may bind an existing weapon with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Pact_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Pact Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bind Pact Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Pact_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Pact Weapon\">Bind Pact Weapon</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Summon a weapon to your hand. It uses the wielder's <a href=\"/wiki/Abilities#Ability_score_modifiers\" title=\"Abilities\">Charisma modifier</a>, and its damage is magical. \n</p>\nYou are <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with the weapon. You can only have one at a time. The weapon disappears if you are more than 1.5 m (5 ft) away from it for more than 10 rounds.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per combat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per combat</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_PactOfTheBlade</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_PactOfTheBlade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_PactOfTheBlade\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Battleaxe\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Battleaxe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Pact_of_the_Blade_Battleaxe_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Battleaxe_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Pact_of_the_Blade_Battleaxe_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Battleaxe_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Pact_of_the_Blade_Battleaxe_Icon.webp/80px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Battleaxe_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Battleaxe\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Pact_of_the_Blade_Battleaxe_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Battleaxe_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Pact_of_the_Blade_Battleaxe_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Battleaxe\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Battleaxe\">Pact of the Blade: Battleaxe</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span c