the Blade: Greatsword</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Rapier\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Rapier\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier_Icon.webp/80px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Rapier\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Rapier\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Rapier\">Pact of the Blade: Rapier</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Trident\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Trident\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Pact_of_the_Blade_Trident_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Trident_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Pact_of_the_Blade_Trident_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Trident_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Pact_of_the_Blade_Trident_Icon.webp/80px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Trident_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Trident\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Pact_of_the_Blade_Trident_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Trident_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Pact_of_the_Blade_Trident_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Trident\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Trident\">Pact of the Blade: Trident</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Warhammer\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Warhammer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Pact_of_the_Blade_Warhammer_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Warhammer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Pact_of_the_Blade_Warhammer_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Warhammer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Pact_of_the_Blade_Warhammer_Icon.webp/80px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Warhammer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Warhammer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Pact_of_the_Blade_Warhammer_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Warhammer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Pact_of_the_Blade_Warhammer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Warhammer\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Warhammer\">Pact of the Blade: Warhammer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Flail\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Flail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/80px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Flail\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Flail\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Flail\">Pact of the Blade: Flail</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Maul\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Maul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/80px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Maul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Maul\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Maul\">Pact of the Blade: Maul</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Sickle\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Sickle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/80px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Sickle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Sickle\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Sickle\">Pact of the Blade: Sickle</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a></li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action DC\">weapon action DC</a> of the summoned Pact Weapon still uses <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> instead of <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>.</li>\n<li>The last three variants, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Flail\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Flail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flail\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Flail\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Flail\">Flail</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Maul\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Maul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Maul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Maul\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Maul\">Maul</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Sickle\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Sickle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sickle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Sickle\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Sickle\">Sickle</a>, are exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hexblade\">Hexblades</a> who choose Pact of the Blade. Other warlock subclasses will not have access to them.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035111\nCache expiry: 86400\nR